<title>USA: Allied Capital sets annual extra payout.</title>
<headline>Allied Capital sets annual extra payout.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Capital Corp said its board declared an annual extra distribution of $0.38 per share, payable January 31, record December 27.</p>
<p>The company earlier increased its quarterly dividend by $0.02 a share to $0.31.</p>
